      "ruleId": "ssc-e06ee4df-1d09-ce0b-6588-dd990d3d4d81",
      "title": "Out-of-bounds Read in io.airlift:aircompressor",
      "description": "Affected versions of io.airlift:aircompressor and io.airlift:aircompressor-v3 are vulnerable to Insertion of Sensitive Information Into Sent Data / Out-of-bounds Read. Aircompressor's Java\u2010based Snappy and LZ4 decompressors do not properly handle malformed compressed data: a crafted input can cause bytes from a previously used output buffer to be emitted in the new uncompressed output. In systems that reuse or don't clear the same decompression buffer across calls, this can leak sensitive data to an attacker.",
